{"id":"vod_bf_13895","vodId":"13895","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"黄金神威第二季","name_cn":"黄金神威第二季","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-15/62082a92317fdcf8ff66d54d10b91015.jpg"},"summary":"明治时代后期，有着“不死之身杉元”外号的日俄战争英雄杉元佐一，因故需要筹措金钱而来到了北海道。他无意间听说阿伊努人手中的财宝被抢夺的传闻。据说宝藏秘密被刻在24名越狱犯身上的刺青，寻宝过程之中，杉元遭受到棕熊的袭击，并且被一名阿伊努人少女“阿席莉帕”所救。紧接着，有如呼应杉元的行动一般，从以前就一直以宝藏为目标在暗中行动的“第七师团”以及背负刺青的越狱犯们的行动也开始浮上台面。这场为求一夕致富的生存竞赛，究竟会如何发展……！？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:42:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinshenweidierji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:56.152Z"}